>>3) My dog stood on a polymorph trap and turned into a Lecrotta(sp?).  Does
>>his dietry habits change?

	Wrt eating habits, pets fall into three categories:  carnivores (dogs,
cats, &c.), metalvores (rock moles, xorn, rust monsters, & I think umber
hulks), and those which just don't eat anything (humanoids, orcs, and demons).
Leucrottas are either in the first or the last group.  Give it a fresh corpse
and if it doesn't take it, don't bother feeding it.





